OL,3,GNEWSADoes Bradford have #15m for a new
OL,4,Apool? It depends on which politician
OL,5,Ayou ask
OL,6,
OL,7,FBradford Council could have an extra
OL,8,F#15m to spend on projects of its own
OL,9,Fchoosing - including the possible
OL,10,Freopening of a much loved swimming
OL,11,Fpool.
OL,13,FBut then again, it might not.
OL,15,FThe confusion has arisen after Shipley
OL,16,FMP Anna Dixon received an intriguing
OL,17,Fletter from a government minister,
OL,18,Fraising fresh hopes that Bingley Pool,
OL,19,Fwhich was closed in 2020, could reopen
OL,20,Fits doors.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
