OL,3,GNEWSADoes Bradford have #15m for a new
OL,4,Apool? It depends on which politician
OL,5,Ayou ask
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe letter suggests that #14.6m of
OL,8,FLevelling Up cash originally given to
OL,9,FBradford Council for a new leisure
OL,10,Fcentre in Girlington, plans for which
OL,11,Fwere scrapped this summer, could
OL,12,Finstead be spent on other schemes of
OL,13,Fthe authority's own choosing.
